-- ==============================================================================
-- Tytul:        setup_path.oby
-- Opis:         Distribution Path dp1 (blok 8 raportu) z deploymentu oggsource do Receivera na ggtgt.
--               Zrodlo zawsze localhost (sciezka startuje na kazdym wezle RAC). Etap A: ws://,
--               etap B: wss://. {{...}} wstawia host (szablon renderowany do guest/out).
-- Description [EN]: Distribution Path dp1 (report block 8) from deployment oggsource to the ggtgt
--               Receiver. The source is always localhost (the path starts on any RAC node). Stage A:
--               ws://, stage B: wss://. {{...}} filled by the host (rendered into guest/out).
-- Autor: KCB Kris | Data: 2026-11-14 | Wersja: 1.0 | Konwencje: <repo>/SETTINGS.md
-- ==============================================================================
ADD DISTPATH dp1 SOURCE trail://localhost:{{OGG_PORT_DIST}}/services/v2/sources?trail=et TARGET {{OGG_PATH_PROTO}}://{{TGT_NAME}}.{{LAB_DOMAIN}}:{{OGG_PORT_RECV}}/services/v2/targets?trail=et AUTHENTICATION USERIDALIAS ggtgt_dp DOMAIN OracleGoldenGate
-- MAA Task 10: restart after a Distribution Service start (LAB: adminclient syntax for Retries 10, Delay 1 min)
START DISTPATH dp1
INFO DISTPATH dp1
